Description: OpenTelemetry Semantic Conventions
 OpenTelemetry is a collection of tools, APIs, and SDKs used to instrument,
 generate, collect, and export telemetry data (metrics, logs, and traces).
 .
 This package provides the OpenTelemetry Semantic Conventions module,
 which defines the standardized attribute names, values, and resource
 conventions used across OpenTelemetry instrumentation for consistent
 telemetry data.
 .
 This package provides the Python 3 library.
